//
// Marks this directory as the Xeto workDir so the CLI resolves obcflex.df
// here rather than walking up to the DFLEXLIBS git root.
//
// The ph libs come from the Haxall install. To build against a local
// Project-Haystack source checkout instead, add it to the path (semicolons
// separate entries, on every platform):
//
//   path=../../../../xeto
//
// See README.md for the version constraints that apply if you do.
//
